{"id":"253f996295270684","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-ground-model.md","title":"基础模型","display":"df-ground-model — 基础模型","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-ground-model","aliases":["91-df-ground-model","91-df-base-model"],"display":"df-ground-model — 基础模型","depends_on":["[[91-df-ground-language]]","[[91-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-ground-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-ground-model</span><span>91-df-base-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ground-model — 基础模型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8e718c83a9cc331\" href=\"?note=c8e718c83a9cc331\" title=\"91-df-structure\">91-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-ground-model-—-基础模型-$\\mathfrak{M}_0$\">df-ground-model — 基础模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}_0\">\\(\\mathfrak{M}_0\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span> (基础语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano算术理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=(\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},0,S^{\\mathbb N},+^{\\mathbb N},\n\\times^{\\mathbb N},&lt;^{\\mathbb N})\">\\(\\mathbb N=(\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},0,S^{\\mathbb N},+^{\\mathbb N},\n\\times^{\\mathbb N},&lt;^{\\mathbb N})\\)</span> (自然数的标准算术结构)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ground\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak M_0\n\\coloneqq\n(\\mathbb N,0,S^{\\mathbb N},+^{\\mathbb N},\\times^{\\mathbb N},&lt;^{\\mathbb N}),\n\\qquad\n\\mathfrak M_0\\models\\mathrm{PA}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ground\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak M_0\n\\coloneqq\n(\\mathbb N,0,S^{\\mathbb N},+^{\\mathbb N},\\times^{\\mathbb N},&lt;^{\\mathbb N}),\n\\qquad\n\\mathfrak M_0\\models\\mathrm{PA}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}_0\">\\(\\mathfrak{M}_0\\)</span> : 基础模型（ground model）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> : 自然数标准模型</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0\">\\(I_0\\)</span>：按符号类别给出的标准解释；它不是一个统一取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 的函数</li>\n</ul>\n<p>基础模型的含义：\n基础模型是基础语言<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span>的标准模型，即自然数的标准结构。</p>\n<p>基础模型的结构：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成分</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>论域</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N} = \\{0, 1, 2, ...\\}\">\\(\\mathbb{N} = \\{0, 1, 2, ...\\}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常量解释</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0, 1, 2, ...\">\\(0, 1, 2, ...\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数解释</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+, \\times\">\\(+, \\times\\)</span>（标准加法、乘法）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系解释</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=\">\\(=\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>（标准等式、小于）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>基础模型与真理扩展的关系：\n真理扩展在基础模型上添加真理谓词的解释：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}_T = (\\mathbb{N}, I_0, I_T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak{M}_T = (\\mathbb{N}, I_0, I_T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_T\">\\(I_T\\)</span>是真理谓词<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>的解释。</p>\n<p>基础模型的关键性质：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}_0\">\\(\\mathfrak{M}_0\\)</span>满足PA</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}_0\">\\(\\mathfrak{M}_0\\)</span>不含真理谓词</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}_0\">\\(\\mathfrak{M}_0\\)</span>是真理扩展的&quot;基础&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>基础模型在固定点构造中的作用：\n固定点构造从基础模型开始，逐步扩展<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>的解释：\n固定点阶段比较的是各阶段的真理外延</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^0\\subseteq\\Gamma^1\\subseteq\\cdots,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma^0\\subseteq\\Gamma^1\\subseteq\\cdots,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>而不是把集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^\\alpha\">\\(\\Gamma^\\alpha\\)</span> 与结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_T^\\alpha\">\\(\\mathfrak M_T^\\alpha\\)</span> 混在同一包含链中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-ground-model-—-基础模型-$\\mathfrak{M}_0$","text":"df-ground-model — 基础模型 $\\mathfrak{M}_0$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c8e718c83a9cc331","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_0$ (基础语言, see [[91-df-ground-language]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak{M}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N=(\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},0,S^{\\mathbb N},+^{\\mathbb N},\n\\times^{\\mathbb N},<^{\\mathbb N})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ground\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak M_0\n\\coloneqq\n(\\mathbb N,0,S^{\\mathbb N},+^{\\mathbb N},\\times^{\\mathbb N},<^{\\mathbb N}),\n\\qquad\n\\mathfrak M_0\\models\\mathrm{PA}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{M}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"I_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{N} = \\{0, 1, 2, ...\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0, 1, 2, ...","display":false},{"tex":"+, \\times","display":false},{"tex":"=","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{M}_T = (\\mathbb{N}, I_0, I_T)","display":true},{"tex":"I_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{M}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{M}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{M}_0","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^0\\subseteq\\Gamma^1\\subseteq\\cdots,","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma^\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_T^\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":2059,"backlinks":[{"id":"ce2e952933d30cc2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2a6ae68f45ba9960","ancho